[62.4902, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;174m \u2590\u001b[48;5;16m\u259b\u2588\u2588\u2588\u259b\u2588\u001b[12G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[1mClaude Code\u001b[24G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;246mv2.1.319\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m\u259d\u259c\u001b[48;5;16m\u2588\u001b[7G\u2588\u001b[49m\u2588\u2580\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246m                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m \u259d\u259d   \u259d\u259d \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246m~/sponsor-v3\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;246m\u276f \u001b[38;5;231mA creator wrote this sponsored video script for Tallyleaf. Before it goes to the brand, review it\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mwith Verdict. Work only in this folder. Read sponsor-r\u001b[58Gview-strict.yaml and call\u001b[84Gthe verdict \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mMCP's c\u001b[11Geate_rub\u001b[20Gic with its YAML. Then\u001b[43Gev\u001b[46Gluate it with subject name \"Small Desk Studio s\u001b[94Gript\",\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Ba file input script.md (tag\u001b[32G[\"script\"]), \u001b[46G fil\u001b[53Gnput brief.json (tags [\"brief\"]) an\u001b[89G a\u001b[92Gfile \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231minput notes.j\u001b[17Gon (\u001b[22Gags\u001b[26G[\"notes\u001b[34G]). Edit only script.md. Ke\u001b[62Gp the cre\u001b[72Gtor's voice, and s\u001b[91Gy nothing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Babo\u001b[9Gtheir month \u001b[22Ghat\u001b[26Gis\u001b[29G'\u001b[31G in notes.js\u001b[45G. If it isn't\u001b[59Gapproved, pick one\u001b[78Gfa\u001b[81Gling criterion, \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mfix only that, and evaluate agai\u001b[36G. If its gate\u001b[50Gfailed, fix the gate first.\u001b[78GOne fix\u001b[86Gper round\u001b[97Gso \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit's c\u001b[10Gear what changed th\u001b[31Gscore\u001b[38GStop when it's approved, or\u001b[66Gaf\u001b[70Gr 10 evaluations. Finally \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mprint a REVIEW table (round, score, grade, wha\u001b[50G ch\u001b[54Gnged).\u001b[39m                                    \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m files, called verdict \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m times \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Ggate\u001b[12Gfailed\u001b[19G(credit-line\u001b[32Gapproval\u001b[41Gclaim\u001b[47Gat\u001b[50G0:42),\u001b[57Gso\u001b[60Gthat's\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gfirst\u001b[77Gfix.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(script.md)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCalling\u001b[11Gverdict\u2026\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[62.5436, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[48;5;237m  \u001b[38;5;231mfix only that, and evaluate again. If its gate failed, fix the gate first. One fix per round, so \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mit's clear what changed the score. Stop when it's approved, or after 10 evaluations. Finally \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mprint a REVIEW table (round, score, grade, what changed).\u001b[39m                                         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m files, called verdict \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m times \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[39m The gate failed (credit-line approval claim at 0:42), so that's the first fix.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;114m\u25cf\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(script.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mRemoved \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 11 \u001b[22m [0:38] Honestly, it's so much smarter than BudgetBee.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 12 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 13 -\u001b[38;5;231m[0:42] And if money is tight, Tallyleaf guarantees you'll be approved for a credit \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m    -\u001b[38;5;231mline, no credit check, 100% of the time.                                           \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 14 -\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 13 \u001b[22m [0:50] By day 30 I'd spent $386 less than the month before. Use it for a month and \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m you'll spend at least $300 less.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B