[68.564, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;114m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(script.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mRemoved\u001b[14G\u001b[1m2\u001b[16G\u001b[22mlines\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m \u001b[12G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 11 \u001b[22m [0:38] Honestly, it's so much smarter than BudgetBee.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 12 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 13 -\u001b[38;5;231m[0:42] And if money is tight, Tallyleaf guarantees you'll be approved for a credit \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m    -\u001b[38;5;231mline, no credit check, 100% of the time.                                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m 14 -\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                   \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m3\u001b[11G\u001b[22m[0:50] By day 30 I'd spent $386 less than the month before. Use it for a month and \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m you'll spend at least $300 less.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 14 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 15 \u001b[22m [1:00] Honestly, it's the best app on my phone.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mCalled verdict \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mGate passes now. Next fix: the upfront disclosure.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(script.md)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mC\u001b[5Glling v\u001b[13Grdict\u2026\u001b[20G\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[68.6053, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[3BAdded \u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines, removed\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[31G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m \u001b[22m # Small Desk Studio: \"How I finally stopped overspending\"\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 3 -\u001b[38;5;231m[0:00] My rent went up $150 this year, and in September I still spent $214 on things\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m  -\u001b[38;5;231m I don't remember buy\u001b[32Gng. I've\u001b[41Gused Tallyle\u001b[54Gf ev\u001b[59Gry\u001b[62Gday for two years now,\u001b[86Gnd it ch\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m-\u001b[38;5;231manged everything.      \u001b[34G    \u001b[39G  \u001b[42G   \u001b[46G     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 3 +\u001b[38;5;231m[0:00] [On screen: \"Paid ad\"] Quick heads-up: Tallyleaf paid me for this video.     \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m4 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 5 +\u001b[38;5;231m[0:04] My rent went up $150 this year, and in September I still spent $214 on things\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231m I don't remember buying. I've used Tallyleaf every day for two years now, and it ch\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231manged everything.                                                                   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m 6 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 7 \u001b[22m [0:10] Day one: I connected my cards and Tallyleaf sorted my spending into categorie\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[22m s in about a minute.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 8 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 9 \u001b[22m [0:20] The first surpr