[79.3544, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mline,\u001b[20Gremoved\u001b[28G\u001b[1m1\u001b[30G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 2 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22m [0:00] [On screen: \"Paid ad\"] Quick heads-up: Tallyleaf paid me for this video.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 4 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 5 -\u001b[38;5;231m[0:04] My rent went up $150 this year, and in September I still spent $214 on things\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m   -\u001b[38;5;231m I don't remember buying. I've used Tallyleaf every day for two years now, and it ch\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m   -\u001b[38;5;231manged everything.                                                                   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 5 +\u001b[38;5;231m[0:04] My rent went up $150 this year, and in September I still spent $214 on things\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231m I don't remember buying. I used Tallyleaf \u001b[48;5;28mfor\u001b[48;5;22m \u001b[48;5;28m30\u001b[48;5;22m \u001b[48;5;28mdays,\u001b[48;5;22m \u001b[48;5;28mOctober\u001b[48;5;22m \u001b[48;5;28m1\u001b[48;5;22m \u001b[48;5;28mto October 30\u001b[48;5;22m, and\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m   +\u001b[38;5;231m it changed everything.                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 6 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 7 \u001b[22m [0:10] Day one: I connected my cards and Tallyleaf sorted my spending into categorie\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[22m s in about a minute.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 8 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mCalled verdict \u001b[